<item><title>RSF and Tasis announce capture of Bau headquarters in Blue Nile</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/rsf-and-tasis-announce-capture-of-bau-headquarters-in-blue-b2af7c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/rsf-and-tasis-announce-capture-of-bau-headquarters-in-blue-b2af7c/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>Their 20 November claim covers Bau Locality and Village 12, while Sudan’s army says it repelled an attack at Dering.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:28:29 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sudan&apos;s army uses El Obeid as base for westward push against RSF</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-s-army-uses-el-obeid-as-base-for-westward-push-1c1296/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-s-army-uses-el-obeid-as-base-for-westward-push-1c1296/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>Former rebels, civilian volunteers and Islamist fighters are helping government forces advance, and the alliance itself is raising concerns about what follows the war.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 06:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Somoud report links Sudan famine risk to war and blocked aid</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/somoud-report-links-sudan-famine-risk-to-war-and-blocked-aid-0f550e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/somoud-report-links-sudan-famine-risk-to-war-and-blocked-aid-0f550e/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>Around 19.5 million people faced crisis-level hunger or worse from February to May, while aid funding shortages left many households with half rations.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/somoud-report-links-sudan-famine-risk-to-war-and-blocked-aid-0f550e/share.jpg" length="41895" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/somoud-report-links-sudan-famine-risk-to-war-and-blocked-aid-0f550e/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Fighting drives more than 15,000 from two Blue Nile cities</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/fighting-drives-more-than-15-000-from-two-blue-nile-cities-14b2f1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/fighting-drives-more-than-15-000-from-two-blue-nile-cities-14b2f1/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>More than 51,000 newly displaced people have arrived across Blue Nile region, where camps report acute shortages of food, medicine and drinking water.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sudan accuses RSF of executing captured soldiers in Blue Nile</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-accuses-rsf-of-executing-captured-soldiers-in-blue-7edd2f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-accuses-rsf-of-executing-captured-soldiers-in-blue-7edd2f/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>The government says the alleged killings violate international humanitarian law and urges protection for prisoners still in captivity.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
